            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-scroll-blue text-scroll-lima flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-[10px] flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">3</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-white block">Monitoreo y reconexión activa:</strong>
